# PERF-1 SMK: CALL AND RESPONSE (Steven's issue #3: his guitar, through a Bento's MIDI out, calls; PERF answers). Notes on the
# Call channel (channel 2 by default) are calls: they play nothing, and the Answer says what PERF does. Piece as pedal.amb:
# A minor (A B C D E F G), followers on.
seed 0
wait 3000
sbtn KNOB_BANK
sbtn KNOB_BANK
sbtn KNOB_BANK
sbtn KNOB_BANK
pad 4
wait 200
expect folon 135
# FOLLOW's third page: call and response. Off at first: a note on channel 2 is not a call
sbtn RIGHT
sbtn RIGHT
expect callset 0
midi 91 40 64
wait 100
expect callact 0
midi 81 40 0
# Call on, Leave room on: HARMONY (the default). A call's E4 is F4's note: F4 sounds while F1-F3 stay
pad 8
pad 11
wait 100
expect callset 144
midi 91 40 64
wait 300
expect callact 1
expect folcpc 5
expect padheld3 4
expect folduck >30
# a Bb (not in A minor) snaps to the scale: A (a half step down is tried first)
midi 81 40 0
midi 91 46 64
wait 300
expect folcpc 10
midi 81 46 0
# a beat with nothing held: the call is over, the duck lets go
wait 1500
expect callact 0
expect folduck <5
# ECHO: two notes, played back on the acid from the next beat, up a fifth
pad 10
expect callset 176
midi 91 45 64
wait 250
midi 81 45 0
midi 91 48 64
wait 250
midi 81 48 0
wait 2500
expect callecho 2
# a new call while nothing echoes: the echo again, an octave up (the next kind)
midi 91 45 64
wait 250
midi 81 45 0
wait 2500
expect callecho 3
# STEER: a call moves the chord a fifth down; a call on A (the key's root) takes it home
pad 10
expect callset 208
midi 91 47 64
wait 200
midi 81 47 0
wait 1500
expect chordroot 2
midi 91 4C 64
wait 200
midi 81 4C 0
wait 1500
expect chordroot 7
midi 91 45 64
wait 200
midi 81 45 0
wait 1500
expect chordroot 9
# SWELL: a call swells the followers over their level
pad 10
expect callset 240
wait 3000
midi 91 45 64
wait 400
expect follvl1 >95
midi 81 45 0
# off: the channel is a channel again; the settings stay (the set list's spare byte) through a reboot
pad 8
expect callset 224
tap PLAY
wait 5000
reboot
wait 3000
expect callset 224
